      <CalendarUID>-1</CalendarUID><FreeformDurationFormat>7</FreeformDurationFormat><EffortDriven>1</EffortDriven>
      <Notes>Maintenance window execution sequence: (1) Disable all BizTalk receive locations and stop all host instances via BizTalk Admin Console or PowerShell. (2) Take final tail-log backup of BizTalkMsgBoxDb and all BizTalk databases on source SQL. (3) Restore all databases to target SQL — NORECOVERY for log chains, RECOVERY for final restore. (4) Synchronize SQL logins via sp_help_revlogin, migrate SQL Agent jobs, replicate DTC configuration. (5) Update SampleUpdateInfo.xml with target server name and run UpdateDatabase.vbs from the BizTalk ConfigFramework folder to repoint BizTalkMgmtDb. (6) Start BizTalk host instances and re-enable receive locations. (7) Process one live test message through each critical endpoint before declaring cutover success and closing the maintenance window.</Notes>
